OL,3,GNEWSATown holds its first community
OL,4,Acook-off event
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and local policing teams have
OL,7,Fcome together for a Berkshire town's
OL,8,Ffirst community cook-off.
OL,10,FInspired by a project launched in
OL,11,FLondon following the Grenfell Tower
OL,12,Fdisaster in 2017, the charity event in
OL,13,FReading, was intended to bring people
OL,14,Ftogether through food, connection and
OL,15,Fshared experiences.
OL,17,FThe idea became reality on Saturday,
OL,18,Fthanks to PC Charlotte Wall from the
OL,19,FMet Police, PCSO Cath and Lisa from the
OL,20,FWhitley Community Development
OL,21,FAssociation, said the organisers.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
